            "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Air Forte is a high-altitude game of math, vocabulary, and geography. Compete with friends or fly solo in the various arenas. Good luck, pilot! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Play with friends:</strong>  Up to four people can play Air Forte together. Find out who's the best pilot!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Stage variety:</strong>  Play through multiple stages that explore math, vocabulary, and geography.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Unlockable game modes:</strong>  Once you complete the Adventure, try the &quot;Challenge&quot; and &quot;Infinite&quot; game modes.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Online high scores:</strong>  Compete against people around the world. Can you beat their scores?</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Gripping story:</strong>  Embark on a royal quest. Only <i>you</i> can unravel the mystery...</p></li></ul>",
